---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Daniel Kocot | API Consultant & Technical Leader">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="min-h-[20vh] bg-white border-b border-gray-200 -mx-4 px-4 mb-12 flex items-center justify-center py-12">
		<div class="text-center max-w-3xl">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#2f3e46]">
				About Me
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
				Building bridges between technology and business through thoughtful API architecture
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Main Content -->
	<article class="prose lg:prose-lg mx-auto mb-16">
		<section class="mb-12">
			<h2>Hello, I'm Daniel</h2>
			<p class="lead">
				I'm a Principal Integration Architect at adorsys GmbH + Co. KG, where I help organizations design and implement 
				scalable, developer-friendly API architectures that power modern digital experiences.
			</p>
			<p>
				With years of experience in software engineering and API design, I've developed a passion for 
				creating systems that are not only technically robust but also delightful for developers to use. 
				I believe that great APIs are the foundation of successful digital products and seamless integrations.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-12">
			<h2>What I Focus On</h2>
			<p>
				My work centers around helping teams navigate the complex landscape of API architecture, 
				event-driven systems, and modern software engineering practices. I specialize in:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>API Strategy & Design</strong> – Creating coherent API ecosystems that scale with business needs</li>
				<li><strong>Event-Driven Architectures</strong> – Building resilient, loosely-coupled systems</li>
				<li><strong>Standards & Best Practices</strong> – Implementing proven patterns like OpenAPI, AsyncAPI, and REST</li>
				<li><strong>Developer Experience</strong> – Ensuring APIs are intuitive, well-documented, and easy to integrate</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-12">
			<h2>Writing & Knowledge Sharing</h2>
			<p>
				I'm the author of <em><a href="https://architecturalbytes.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0b6bcb] hover:text-[#2f3e46] underline">Architectural Bytes</a></em>, 
				a publication on Substack where I explore software architecture, API design patterns, industry standards, 
				and the organizational challenges of building complex systems. My writing aims to bridge the gap between 
				theory and practice, offering actionable insights for technical leaders and engineers.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-12">
			<h2>Speaking & Community</h2>
			<p>
				I regularly speak at conferences, meetups, and corporate events about API architecture, 
				event-driven systems, and software engineering best practices. I believe in the power of 
				community knowledge-sharing and enjoy connecting with fellow practitioners to exchange ideas 
				and experiences.
			</p>
			<p>
				Interested in having me speak at your event? 
				<a href="/contact" class="text-[#0b6bcb] hover:text-[#2f3e46] underline">Let's talk!</a>
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>

	<!-- Skills / Technologies Section -->
	<section class="mb-16 not-prose">
		<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">Technologies & Expertise</h2>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<div class="bg-[#f7f8f9] rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#2f3e46] flex items-center">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
					</svg>
					API Design & Standards
				</h3>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">REST</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">GraphQL</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">OpenAPI</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">AsyncAPI</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">gRPC</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">WebSockets</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-[#f7f8f9] rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#4e5d6a] flex items-center">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4" />
					</svg>
					Event-Driven Systems
				</h3>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#4e5d6a] text-white">Apache Kafka</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#4e5d6a] text-white">RabbitMQ</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#4e5d6a] text-white">Event Sourcing</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#4e5d6a] text-white">CQRS</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#4e5d6a] text-white">Message Patterns</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-[#f7f8f9] rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#0b6bcb] flex items-center">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
					</svg>
					Architecture Patterns
				</h3>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#0b6bcb] text-white">Microservices</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#0b6bcb] text-white">Domain-Driven Design</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#0b6bcb] text-white">Clean Architecture</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#0b6bcb] text-white">API Gateway</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#0b6bcb] text-white">Service Mesh</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-[#f7f8f9] rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#2f3e46] flex items-center">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
					</svg>
					Tools & Platforms
				</h3>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">Kubernetes</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">Docker</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">CI/CD</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">API Management</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-[#2f3e46] text-white">Cloud Platforms</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA Section -->
	<section class="text-center py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2f3e46]/10 to-[#4e5d6a]/10 rounded-lg -mx-4 px-4 not-prose">
		<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Let's Work Together</h2>
		<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			Whether you need consulting on API architecture, a speaker for your event, 
			or just want to discuss the latest in software engineering – I'm here to help.
		</p>
		<div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
			<a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium rounded-lg text-white bg-[#2f3e46] hover:bg-[#4e5d6a] transition-colors">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
				</svg>
				Get in Touch
			</a>
			<a href="/talks" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium rounded-lg text-[#2f3e46] border-2 border-[#2f3e46] hover:bg-[#2f3e46] hover:text-white transition-colors">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
				</svg>
				View Talks
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
